
objective_protect_name = Protect Assasination Target 
objective_protect_desc = Due to bureaucratic error another agent was tasked with elimination of <target>, we need you to protect them from harm and make sure they arrive back to CC unharmed.

objective_CorporateClimber_name = Climb the ladder 
objective_CorporateClimber_description = Become the new head of your NT assigned department, to ensure no records are flagged, the old one has to be demoted.

objective_Gravityoff_name = Disable gravity aboard the station. 
objective_Gravityoff_desc = Agent, You are tasked with making sure that the station has no gravitational field for at least <time>. We do not care how you achieve this objective as long as it is complete.

objective_ShoeRemove_name = NoBoot camp 
objective_ShoeRemove_desc = Agent, Your Objective is to Minimise the amount of footwear aboard the station, make sure there is less than 10 pieces of boots availible.

objective_RemoveSteel_name = No Steel for you. 
objective_RemoveSteel_desc = You must deplete the station of as much steel as possible, remove the walls if need be.

objective_insecurity_name = Empty Security's Armory 
objective_insecurity_desc = Agent. You are to make sure that all weaponry available to security is no longer availible. You are free to do with the weapons as you please. Death to Nanotrasen!

objective_burnNothing_name = Run on Fumes
objective_burnNothing_desc = Deplete welding fuel reserves across the station. Either by breaking windows a smidge, or by stealing and marooning welding fuel stockpiles.

objective_BombDepartment_name = Bomb <Deparment>
objective_BombDepartment_desc = The <Department> has been operating too smoothly. Kindly remind them that they are bombable. Try to keep casualties to a minimum; this is to teach a lesson that no one is safe.

objective_RemoveTEG_name = Destroy the Thermo Electric Generator
objective_RemoveTEG_desc = Nanotrasen has been flooding the energy credit market with Power Transmision Beams, we want you to stop this, at the source.

objective_AllTheLittleGuys_name All the pets must be mine.
objective_AllTheLittleGuys_traitor_desc The syndicate requires a bargaining chip of minor value, all station pets should suffice, steal and collect them all.

objective_TempPromotionRD_name = Get promoted to Acting Research Director 
objective_TempPromotionRD_desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for obtaining valuable research secrets in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Research Director by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.  

objective_TempPromotionQM_name = Get promoted to Acting Quartermaster 
objective_TempPromotionQM_desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for embezzlement in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Quartermaster by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.  

objective_TempPromotionCE_name = Get promoted to Chief Engineer 
objective_TempPromotionCE_desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for stealing station blueprints in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Chief Engineer by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.  

objective_TempPromotionCMO_name = Get promoted to Acting Chief Medical Officer 
objective_TempPromotionCMO_desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for discreetly poisoning targets in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Chief Medical Officer by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.  

objective_TempPromotionHOP_name = Get promoted to Acting Head of Personnel 
objective_TempPromotionHOP_desc = The syndicate wants to prep an undercover agent for getting our agents the right access and jobs in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Head of Personnel by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise. 

objective_InciteRiot_name = Cause a riot that security needs to put down.
objective_InciteRiot_desc = Sow discord between the stations security and crew by causing some sort of disturbance that needs putting down. A riot, protest, anything that makes security take their riot gear out of the armoury will do.

objective_DrugedDrinks_name = unsafe bars
objective_DrugedDrinks_desc = NTs bars are a safe space and there drinks are to trusted. Ensure that most drinks consumed at the bar are spiked with psycadelics or poisons.

objective_DrugedFood_name = unsafe litchen
objective_DrugedFood_desc = NTs kitchen are a safe space and there food is to trusted. Ensure that most food consumed at the kitchen is spiked with psycadelics or poisons.

objective_maroonSalvageShip_name = Destroy the salvage shuttle.
objective_maroonSalvageShip_desc = We're getting tired of wandering salvagers discovering our infiltration ships, listening posts and other spaceborne installations. Stop this.

objective_maroonCargoShip_name = Destroy the cargo shuttle.
objective_maroonCargoShip_desc = Nanotrasen shuttlecraft is getting too robust. Send their shipping fleet a message.

objective_SlimeCleanup_name = Clean Up Xenobiology
objective_SlimeCleanup_desc = Kill all slimes in Xenobiology and dispose of the corpses to slow down scientific research. You're basically doing them a favor.

objective_SpeciesSwap_name = Change Someone's Species
objective_SpeciesSwap_desc = Nanotrasen staff are too prideful in their appearances. Ensure <target> returns to CentComm as a different species than what they started the shift as.

objective_Beeornottobee_name = Cover entire <department> with bees! 
objective_Beeornottobee_desc = Bee Liberation front needs your help, <department> has been found to be oppressing bees! Your uplink has a box of grenades containing our solider bees. For freedom! Death to Nanotrasen!

objective_ShowOff_name = Impress your Handler
objective_ShowOff_desc = Your handler has noticed we haven’t been showing off well enough. Make sure your objectives are complied with in the most creative way possible today. This doesn’t mean kill everyone. Impress us.

objective_CaptureStation_name = Become Captain 
objective_CaptureStation_desc = Become the new Captain of this ship. It's time we take over for the Syndicate!

objective_IdentityTheft_name = Steal Identites 
objective_IdentityTheft_desc = A high paying client requests a copy of every command role identification card on the station. through any means necessary steal the identity card of every command operative in the station, kill them or leave them alive, you get their ID's to evac and the rest is up to you.

objective_CargoExtraction_name = Steal high value cargo silo 
objective_CargoExtraction_desc = The Material Silo cargo has is of high interest to the syndicate, your objective is simple, get the silo.

objective_TheZookeepersApprentice_name = Replace tiles 
objective_TheZookeepersApprentice_desc = The on-station zookeeper finds the living spaces for his animals to be too small and cramped! Replace all of the tiles on the station with Astro-grass, ice, and snow.”

objective_Bribe_Target_name = Bribery 
objective_Bribe_Target_desc = Bribe <Target> for their well sought after PDA/Job unique item. It should be no big deal. Make sure it's clean and goes unnoticed.

objective_BorgThem_name = Turn <target> into a cyborg
objective_BorgThem_desc = <target> has said some things to a high command's personal cyborg they shouldn't have, show them what it's like and turn them into a cyborg.

objective_Organ_harvesting_name = Organ harvesting 
objective_Organ_harvesting_desc =Get <Organ> from <Target> and have it on you or in you as you get to central command. they are a perfect match for the bosses niece

SabotageDepartment objective_SabotageDepartment_name = Sabotage a department 
objective_SabotageDepartment_desc = The station you've been assigned to has been outperforming it's competitors, knock it down a peg. Destroy a department's critical infrastructure, force their crew to leave the area, or otherwise damage their productivity.

objective_Shrink_the_station_name = Shrink the station 
objective_Shrink_the_station_desc =Make sure the station is smaller at the end of the shift then it is at the beginning

objective_Maintsremove_name = Remove maintenance 
objective_Maintsremove_desc = Get rid of those maintenance shafts, those Engineers, Greytiders and Monsters would be better fitted terrorising departments than scrounging in the darkness all shift.

objective_VoxVengence_name = Vox revenge
objective_VoxVengence_desc = <target> has been speciesist towards a vox member of high command, show them what its like and make sure whatever body they are in has vox lungs. Remember biogenerators exist!

objective_SyndieGang_name = Start a gang 
objective_SyndieGang_desc = The Syndicate wants a presence on this station but can't send more agents. Start a gang with at least <number> non-Syndicate agents. What you do with the exactly is up to you, but make sure your presence is known. Consider collecting 'protection' fees, selling drugs, or putting your gang members in positions of power by any means necessary.

objective_SpreadPropaganda_name = Down with Nanotrasen! 
objective_SpreadPropaganda_desc = Produce and distribute Anti-NT Propaganda in the form of leaflets, syndicate merchandise, and leaked secrets, a reminder that emagging vending machines can give you free syndicate merch!

objective_LawsuitSyndicate_name = Sue Nanotrasen 
objective_LawsuitSyndicate_desc = In the wake of the Space Court overturning Spess v. Weh, corporations are once again liable for damages caused on their stations. Capitalize on this opportunity by orchestrating or fabricating a situation in which Nanotrasen or one of its departments owes you money. This could be an excessive force case against security, an insurance fraud scheme against cargo, or anything else your evil little legal mind can dream up. The more time, money, and crew braincells expended, the better.

objective_RevivalObjective_name = Waste Medical Recources
objective_RevivalObjective_desc = Nanotrasen recently ordered another fresh shipment of medcial supplies to your station, it would be a shame if it went to waste. Die <number> times to put them to good use.

objective_FrameMurder_name = Frame the Target 
objective_FrameMurder_desc = Kill <Target_1> and set the blame on <Target_2>, getting them arrested. Speaking out loud to us comes a price. Our handler is expecting them to arrive at CC in cuffs.

businesscard_name = Nothing personal
objective_businesscard_desc = Eliminate a random crewmember and leave a business card by their body.

objective_ReallyTeachALesson_name = Teach <Crewmember> a lesson 
objective_ReallyTeachALesson_name =  <Crewmember> has made one too many mistakes, its time we taught them a lesson they wont forget. Teach them 10 fun facts on a space station related topic of your choice.

objective_RadioHijack_name = Hijack the Radio
objective_RadioHijack_desc = We've got a whole box of Syndicate ads going unplayed, so it's up to you to make them useful. Ensure that a Syndicate-branded radio disk is played at least 3 times this shift, so it really sinks in.

objective_AiLawChange_name = Change the ai's laws
objective_AiLawChange>_desc = High command on your station has been boasting about their untouchable ai, show them we can modify it at any time we want to. Change the ai's laws with any lawboard atleast once, make sure you are the one doing it.

objective_PowerNoMore_name = power outage
objective_PowerNoMore_desc = Cause a multi departmental poweroutage that lasts for more than 10 minutes

objective_PowerSkinkDetonation_name = Powersink detonation
objective_PowerSkinkDetonation_desc = Due recent reports about powersink malfunctions, we require you to perform a field test of one powersink from our current batch

objective_SabotageComms_name = Sabotage a communications frequency
objective_SabotageComms_desc = We want you to take down as many coms channels as possible for a minimum combined duration over the shift of 6 minutes. Whack the telecommunications server until it stops working or eject the key, we dont care how you do it just make sure theres some downtime.

objective_SneakyTime_name = Be stealthy
objective_SneakyTime_desc = Your handler has been doing budget cuts and is unable to pay coverup costs today. Make sure your objectives are complied with as quietly as possible, or at least keep your presence unknown!”

objective_incompMajor_name = Fake it 'till you make it
objective_incompMajor_desc = We managed to infiltrate you on the station with this job, we know you aren't qualified and that's the point. Be incompetent, a minor inconvenience to your coworkers and crewmates, without getting fired.

objective_SyndicateFraud_name = Commit Fraud 
objective_SyndicateFraud_desc = We want you to prove that Nanotrasen's internal security is terrible. Commit fraud and get away with it. You could promise to do something in exchange for a valuable item and then run off while keeping your payment, get yourself promoted or recognized by taking credit for the work of others, pass off as someone you are not to get access to or steal something, or secretly embezzle resources while going unnoticed. The choice is yours, but the more it will embarrass Nanotrasen when revealed, the better. Make sure to write a report we can plagariz- I mean, use to write an embarassing news article.

objective_VoxStation_name = Vox Station 
objective_VoxStation_desc = Vox have had to breath out of a tank for too long, its everyone else's turn. Set distro to only use nitrogen

objective_SecurityDemotion_name = Get a member of security fired
objective_SecurityDemotion_desc = <security officer> pissed a member of Syndicate high command off, make sure they lose their job. We dont care how you do it, jsut get it done..

objective_CommandDemtoion_name = Get a member of command fired
objective_SecurityDemotion_desc = <command member> pissed a member of Syndicate high command off, make sure they lose their job. We dont care how you do it, just get it done.

objective_HostageSituation_Syndicate_name = Take a Hostage
objective_HostageSituation_Syndicate_description = Nanotrasen believes their crew are safe. Remind them this is not the case. Take a crew member hostage and hold them for at least twenty minutes. Command staff are encouraged, but not required. This is a message, not an assassination. Avoid killing unless the situation collapses.

objective_PrisonerRescue_name = Recover the Asset
objective_PrisonerRescue_desc = A high-value prisoner is currently being held aboard the station. Locate them, secure their cooperation if necessary, ensure they survive until the end of the shift and successfully escape NanoTrasen custody.

objective_PrisonerAssassination_name = Terminate the Asset
objective_PrisonerAssassination_desc = A high-value prisoner aboard the station possesses information that cannot be allowed to reach Central Command. Locate the prisoner and ensure they are dead before the end of the shift.

objective_ReplaceAi_name = Replace the AI
objective_ReplaceAi_desc = We want literally ANYTHING else to be the ai for your shift, dont ask us why. You will need two intellicards, one to download the current AI and the other to install a new intelligence. Remember that you can use the intellicard to download postronic brains or pAIs!

objective_FreeWorkers_name = Liberate the Workers of <Department> 
objective_FreeWorkers_desc = While the Syndicate cannot yet authorize a full Revolution, you've been sent ahead to build a Sleeper Cell. Ensure that all (or most) members of a department are converted to the cause and remain so. Your mission is to build, not destroy, do not bring this army against the Station unless they force your hand.

objective_CyberneticSmuggling_name = Cybernetic Smuggling
objective_CyberneticSmuggling_desc = One of our best operatives were caught and permanently incarcerated recently. Your duty is to gather tools and join their ranks for an eventual breakout. Use station resources to install an Cybernetic Arm Toolkit and get yourself taken to Central Command as a prisoner. Take care not to get yourself executed.

objective_JoyRider_name = Joy Rider
objective_JoyRider_desc = Nothing is cooler than driving a stolen vehicle! Make it to evac while piloting a vehicle.

objective_LockThemAway_name = Get <target> into perma
objective_LockThemAway_desc = We don't care how you do it, make sure <target> is in perma forever, them showing up at centcomm in cuffs but not being a perma isn't a job done but its better than nothing